{"id":"7197","name":"OpenLedger","address":"bsc:0xa227cc36938f0c9e09ce0e64dfab226cad739447","symbol":"OPEN","url":"https://www.openledger.xyz/","description":"OpenLedger is a blockchain platform for AI that enables on-chain training, deployment, and tracking of data, models, and agents. It provides verifiable attribution, provenance, and incentive mechanisms to monetize datasets and AI outputs, addressing transparency and compensation challenges in decentralized AI systems.","chain":"Ethereum","logo":"https://icons.llamao.fi/icons/protocols/openledger","audits":"2","gecko_id":"openledger-2","cmcId":"37456","category":"Decentralized AI","chains":["Open"],"audit_links":["https://github.com/openledger-dev/openledger/blob/master/audit/OpenLedger-OPEN-Final-Report.pdf"],"module":"openledger","twitter":"OpenledgerHQ","github":["openledger-dev"],"listedAt":1767121232,"dimensions":{"fees":"openledger"},"methodology":{"Fees":"Users pay OPEN tokens for two primary services: (1) purchasing AI credits to access and interact with AI models, and (2) creating datanets. All payments are made in OPEN tokens.","UserFees":"All fees are paid by end-users either to purchase AI credits or to create datanets within the protocol.","Revenue":"All payments made for AI credits and datanet creation are collected by the protocol. Credit payments are deposited into protocol-controlled vaults, while datanet creation fees are sent directly to the protocol treasury.","ProtocolRevenue":"100% of collected fees are considered protocol revenue at the time of payment. Credit-related funds may later be distributed to model contributors from the vault, but are initially controlled by the protocol."},"misrepresentedTokens":false,"doublecounted":false,"tvlCodePath":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/DefiLlama-Adapters/blob/main/registries/sumTokens.js","defillamaId":"7197","displayName":"OpenLedger","methodologyURL":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/dimension-adapters/blob/master/fees/openledger","forkedFrom":null,"